<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσεμνύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extol, glorify,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				168d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.47
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with fut.
			
				Med.
			, <i>give oneself solemn airs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				703
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσεμνῠνεῖται πρῶτον</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				833
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Arc.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψὲ ἀπεσεμνύνθη,</span> of
			Tragedy, <i>assumed a dignified form,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1449a20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσεμνυνάμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					26(14).63
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat.,
				<i>pride oneself on,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρίδι, κάλλει,</span> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Aed.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, al.</div>
